Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:55:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] First visit: --split moves the code Home and My Team
 don't need at start into v2-late.js

Change 3 of docs/rebuild/research/first-visit-nov18.md, behind --split only (the one-file build is unchanged).
- parts-v2.json "late": 26 files (the Battle, Calc, Speed, Meta, Usage, Sets, Types, Practice, Test run, Guide, Compare,
  Events, This Week, Track, share-image pages and their data) go in dist/v2-late.js.
- app/split-late.mjs: esbuild does the scope work between the main closure and the late file.
- app/src/v2/late.js: the loader. A late page shows the loading panel, then draws; taps that need late code wait for it;
  the file is asked for when idle after today's numbers, or at the first tap or key.
- Kept in the main script, because Home or My Team read them at start: archetypes.js (Home's Archetypes band,
  V2.arData), box.js (V2.shareTxt in the Pokemon sheet), 31-box-data.js and winning.js (box and archetypes pages).
- Behaviour harness copies v2-late.js and can serve over http (HTTP=1); Preview kit copies and publishes v2-late.js.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YGeTVQdFPaKNkn33jSEpxs
